@startuml
[*] --> Running

state Running {
  [*] --> Configuring : configuration required
  Configuring --> Running : configuration completed
}

Running --> CollectingData : clock triggered
CollectingData --> Running : data collection finished

Running --> PreparingSummary : summary requested
PreparingSummary --> Running : summary prepared and sent

Running --> CheckingStatus : status checked
CheckingStatus --> Running : status transmitted

Running --> ControlledMode : remote control received
ControlledMode --> ShuttingDown : shutdown command given
ShuttingDown --> [*]
@enduml
